{"gems":{"name":"rubocop-kata","downloads":17809,"version":"0.10.1","version_created_at":"2026-09-26T14:19:03.697Z","version_downloads":118,"platform":"ruby","ruby_abi":null,"authors":"Giacomo GK","info":"Bundles a curated RuboCop stack (rspec, performance, elegant, packaging, thread_safety) behind one dependency, layers opinionated style defaults on top, and adds eighteen cops of its own — naming (GoodMethodName, GoodVariableName, dictionary-backed RealWords, GoodClassName, GoodModuleName, BuilderNoun), discipline (IoDiscipline, ClockDiscipline, EnvDiscipline, ConstructorDiscipline, NoClassMethodLogic), and shape (NoComments, NoBooleanFlag, NoHashAsObject, ProsePlacement). The rubocop-kata command reports dead configuration (doctor), buckets a backlog into the stages that cause each other (plan), and prints an agent skill for working it (skill).","licenses":["MIT"],"metadata":{"changelog_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata/issues","source_code_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata","rubygems_mfa_required":"true","default_lint_roller_plugin":"RuboCop::Kata::Plugin"},"yanked":false,"sha":"a1dfb67e496817c3dd1d45623d4f3f6ff2283c610e143f8614828ae83b025b2e","spec_sha":"d2bd8b562a6ca22e62aee4f58d80dc15a34f0ce7dac493638b9910672b3b18ae","project_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/rubocop-kata","gem_uri":"https://rubygems.org/gems/rubocop-kata-0.10.1.gem","homepage_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata","wiki_uri":null,"documentation_uri":null,"mailing_list_uri":null,"source_code_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata","bug_tracker_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata/issues","changelog_uri":"https://github.com/giacope/rubocop-kata/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md","funding_uri":null,"dependencies":{"development":[],"runtime":[{"name":"lint_roller","requirements":"~> 1.1"},{"name":"rubocop","requirements":"~> 1.75"},{"name":"rubocop-elegant","requirements":"~> 0.7"